00:27:01.645 --> 00:27:08.020
Whereas MIT ranks, in the past,
number one sore eye school.

00:27:08.020 --> 00:27:09.865
So, yeah, the fact
that they want

00:27:09.865 --> 00:27:13.565
it to look really beautiful
and really ideal, and--

00:27:13.565 --> 00:27:15.190
CHRIS BOEBEL: On a
